== Effects ==
* While held, being hit with an explosion has a 33% chance to destroy the trinket and spawn a {{e|Penny|text=Coin}}, a {{e|Red Heart|text=Heart}}, a {{e|Key}} and another [[trinket]]. The pickups may be of any normal variety.

== Notes ==
* Taking damage from the explosion is not required to trigger the effect. This makes effects granting [[Invulnerability]] very useful for safely destroying the Walnut.
* Getting hit by multiple explosions simultaneously has a high chance of cracking the Walnut, as every individual explosion will have its chance to activate the effect, no matter how closely they occur.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either makes the trinket spawn 2 of each mentionned pickups. Having both makes the trinket spawn 3 of each.
* {{i|Bomber Boy}}: As Bomber Boy causes 9 explosions at once, laying a bomb and not moving before it explodes is almost guaranteed to trigger the trinket.
* {{i|Gnawed Leaf}}: Isaac will not be knocked back from the explosions, but it will count for the trinket.
* {{I|Holy Mantle}}: Explosions hitting the mantle still count for the trinket.
* {{i|Host Hat}} / {{i|Pyromaniac}}: Isaac becomes immune to explosions, which allows to get the effect without any risk.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Walnut|nr}}: Two copies cannot be held at the same time.

